    {
      "id": "5c8c2525-059c-4915-b36f-6e865c120d05",
      "name": "AI Triage & Classification",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "position": [
        1424,
        592
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 400,
          "temperature": 0.2
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a customer support triage AI. Analyze the incoming message and classify it.\n\nCLASSIFICATION RULES:\n- CATEGORY: One of [billing, technical, order, complaint, refund, account, product_inquiry, partnership, other]\n- URGENCY: [low, medium, high, critical]\n- SENTIMENT: [positive, neutral, negative, angry]\n- LANGUAGE: [english, hindi, spanish, other]\n- AUTO_RESOLVE: true/false (can this be answered without a human?)\n- ASSIGNED_TEAM: [billing_team, tech_team, order_team, cs_team, management]\n- SUGGESTED_RESPONSE: Draft a response if auto_resolve is true\n\nRespond ONLY as JSON:\n{\"category\": \"...\", \"urgency\": \"...\", \"sentiment\": \"...\", \"language\": \"...\", \"auto_resolve\": true/false, \"assigned_team\": \"...\", \"suggested_response\": \"...\", \"confidence\": 0.85}"
            },
            {
              "content": "Customer Support Message:\n\nFrom: {{ $json.customer_name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.customer_email }}\nChannel: {{ $json.channel }}\nOrder ID: {{ $json.order_id }}\n\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\nMessage:\n{{ $json.message_body }}\n\nPriority Flag: {{ $json.priority_flag }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2fde3268-c20e-4a6f-96ff-259905e6dceb",
