      "parameters": {
        "width": 960,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "Title: Workflow Overview: Enterprise AI Support Hub\nContent:\nThis workflow acts as an automated, multi-channel customer support system. It captures incoming tickets from various sources (Email, Web, WhatsApp) and uses AI to instantly read, classify, and determine the sentiment and urgency of every message.\n\nBased on the AI's analysis, the system makes decisions:\n\nFor simple queries, it automatically drafts and sends a response directly to the customer.\n\nFor complex, angry, or critical tickets, it creates a detailed record in HubSpot, logs the metrics, and immediately escalates the issue to the human support team via Slack.\n\nIt also runs an independent background check to monitor SLA deadlines, ensuring no high-priority ticket is ever left unresolved.\n\nIn short: It is a complete intake, AI-triage, and routing engine that handles the busywork so your human agents only focus on the tickets that actually need their attention."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
